5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to be here. I believe we should start by understanding our financial boundaries and the potential for sustainability.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I agree. However, financial boundaries are meaningless if we don't know if previous attempts actually worked. Logic dictates we look at outcomes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think we should also consider the people who will actually do the work. Harmony in the workplace depends on manageable workloads.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited! But we have to make sure the hospital can actually handle more people. We can't have the parking lot overflowing!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,You all make such wonderful points. I worry about the longevity of these programs and whether the partners truly commit for the long term.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I shall look into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial and what the booking system records.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'll check the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, and the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm going for rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
